"value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le16ob03re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le16ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le16ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le16ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Peter. How is your salad?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  It is not fit for people to eat. &nbsp;Just kidding! How is your lobster?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Delicious. Have you ever had the lobster here?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Ah. No. How can you eat all that and not get fat?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Just lucky I guess. Say, did you hear the news about the man on the freeway sign?&nbsp;It was reported two days ago?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  No, I didn&rsquo;t. What happened?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Well, you know highway 6, right? Have you ever driven on the 6 before?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Yes, I&rsquo;ve driven on the 6, more often than you have.<br/>"}, {"time": "30800", "image": "engenn8le16ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Ok. Then you know that huge freeway sign that was built last year ... just before the bridge?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Yeah, I have seen that sign before.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  &nbsp;Well, you&rsquo;ll never believe what happened. A young man driving a Porshe, hit another car in front of him. The young man&rsquo;s car flipped and because he wasn&rsquo;t wearing a seatbelt, he was thrown from the vehicle.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Oh my God. That&rsquo;s horrible.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Wait, it gets stranger. The man was found by police ... lying on the top of that highway sign.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  No way!<br/>"}, {"time": "58750", "image": "engenn8le16ob03re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  The force of the accident combined with the speed he was driving tossed him up onto the sign.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Did he die?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  No! He did not, thank goodness! He broke several bones though, but they say he&rsquo;ll be ok. Isn&rsquo;t that amazing?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  It is not the craziest story I have ever heard, but it is pretty close. Also, It&rsquo;s good because now, people won&rsquo;t want to talk about my costume party story.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Hahah. I would not bet on that.<br/>"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}